---
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
import { footerColumns } from '../data/nav';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 mt-auto">
  <div class="container-xl py-12">

    <!-- Top Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 pb-10 border-b border-slate-200">

      <!-- Brand Column -->
      <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-1">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 
                      flex items-center justify-center text-white font-black text-sm">V</div>
          <span class="font-black text-lg tracking-tight">
            <span class="text-slate-900">VPNs</span><span class="text-brand-600">Top</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed max-w-[200px]">
          专业中文机场与VPN评测平台，独立测速，客观公正。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Nav Columns -->
      {footerColumns.map((col) => (
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
            {col.title}
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5">
            {col.links.map((link) => (
              <li>
                <a href={link.href}
                   class="text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors duration-150">
                  {link.label}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
        © {year} {SITE.name}. 保留所有权利。
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-xl text-center sm:text-right leading-relaxed">
        本站内容仅供技术研究与参考，不构成任何法律建议。请遵守当地法律法规。
        翻墙行为的一切法律责任由使用者自行承担。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
